{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "9780802ae575d0242790ba41cb7cf7962060cdc450fa06da90287d2409eed67e", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}！\nこの衣装、貸してもらってもいい？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}！\n这套服装可以借本人一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2f3ddddb1908ccac96623e1b99d733da1a186a53588b44e5ed6bfe7216028632", "ja": "その衣装を……？\nいいけど、どうするつもりなんだ？", "zh": "借那套服装……？\n可以是可以，但你要用来做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "7f8add2c6784a6b10b46314f7aeb078d99ddfa03455fa9c36dc29db3fa102d8f", "ja": "この前書いたブログ、いぬ美に見せたら、\nすっごく興奮してたんだ～。衣装が気に入ったみたい。", "zh": "本人把之前写的部落格给汪美看过以后，牠超兴奋的～\n牠好像很喜欢那套服装的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "1737f5af2042b2b01430b5ec1fc22700e33f6e3383d8b31d58001acaaa1a7b62", "ja": "だから、本物を見せてやろうと思って！", "zh": "所以本人想让牠看看真正的服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1004_p", "source_sha256": "559e0f7ab1650fd05d0ceeec592f8293be7cccbdcfaada258cb5b16e00d35d49", "ja": "え……。それはつまり、\nいぬ美に衣装を着せるつもりってことか？", "zh": "咦……你的意思是，\n想让汪美穿上那套服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "1465bbb96803826e87e2df04b72b590c4847b2131b257573c2b5de2073d17b83", "ja": "そんなワケないでしょ！？　いぬ美はセントバーナード\nなんだぞ！　しかも相当大きい方だし！", "zh": "怎么可能啊！？汪美可是圣伯纳犬喔！\n而且还是很大只的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "eef08b4277d8c0ab1015bdf6c5bad12735ad7d009d355a9f15399977e19fdea0", "ja": "それに、いぬ美と自分じゃサイズが違いすぎるぞ～。\n自分、そんなに太くないでしょ～？", "zh": "而且，汪美和本人的尺寸差很多耶～\n本人没那么胖吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3a48cbf57e87006fafa0170536ef6637bed73961cce255acd1335fedcd0c5e2f", "ja": "ごめんごめん、そういう意味で言ったんじゃないん\nだけど、ちょっと気になったもんだから……。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，我不是那个意思，\n只是有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "b7fb0e6cccb8614076113365f09f591cb0839022f97422b0191f98bc99127bc3", "ja": "ただ、自分が着てるところを直接見せたい\nだけだぞ。いぬ美たちは、自分の家族だからね！", "zh": "只是想让牠看看本人穿上服装的样子而已喔。\n因为汪美牠们，是本人的家人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "78e0057f16ea5b50715e4ab4c9393e39c41e2cdf01e6625fce8c83ca8d6d0101", "ja": "いぬ美のよだれとか、絶対つけないように気をつける\nから……お願いっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "本人会很小心，绝不会让服装沾到汪美的口水之类……\n所以拜托你了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1010_p", "source_sha256": "53130ff656ae9237d819d156baba2288d333ecb0747075e3c583299961bfd1c4", "ja": "わかった。スタッフさんに頼んで、\n響が持って帰れるように手配しておくよ。", "zh": "知道了，我会去拜托工作人员，\n让响能够带那套服装回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "52dddd11027c3b21dd75e10cdee840921d7a96b5bbf8aada4aaa2827530cb3e9", "ja": "やったー！　ありがとう{$P$}！\nいぬ美もハム蔵もシマ男も……みんなきっと喜ぶぞ！", "zh": "太棒了！谢谢你，{$P$}！\n汪美和哈姆藏和花男……牠们一定都会很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "2439237f19193ac43ca25a96bd00ecad5fd0c8340a471b73731c10cfa22b03e8", "ja": "ライブ会場には、なかなかみんなを連れてこられないけ\nど、自分のアイドル姿、たくさん見てもらいたいんだ。", "zh": "虽然很难带大家来演唱会会场，\n但本人想让牠们多看看本人当偶像的模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "dec9e04be62ef02be8e307d43fd46b77c7d9359a06fbeb9fcc7e4369448eb873", "ja": "自分も、頑張ってるとこを誰かに見ててもらえたら、\nもっともっと頑張れる気がするし！", "zh": "如果能有人看着自己努力的样子，\n感觉就能更加努力了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3563b62a7b769f83c29374e30124e83bdf58a3208ea227f17a3d848e7bde4983", "ja": "そうか……。でも、忘れないでくれよ。響が頑張って\nいるところは、俺が一番近くで見ているからな！", "zh": "是这样啊……但别忘了，\n我会在离响最近的地方，看着你努力的样子喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "610c50b079fb3d4e6879d74f609d37182121830736002f08a00cf16dd5182d5c", "ja": "{$P$}……。えへへ、そうだねっ！", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿嘿，你说得对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0034_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "65b81e7853b84898a233eb8ffe0bd8d97c57cfa05a00b9e8354a37864f87c864", "ja": "うん、わかった！　自分、忘れてないけど、\nこれからも忘れないっ。……ずっと！", "zh": "嗯，知道了！本人虽然没有忘记，\n但今后也不会忘记的……永远不会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
